    //                            PATTERN; index-encoded callers 0/1/2
    //                            degenerate to UNSPECIFIED, which no real
    //                            platform contract ever allowed).
    //   makeSafeMeasureSpec(size, mode) = UNSPECIFIED → 0, else makeMeasureSpec
